/E (design. High pass filters are typically AC coupled at the input therefore limited by a max RF power handling specification while low pass filters typically have a DC short in the through path with a max DC current capability. Filters with larger elements and wider traces \(as seen in distributed element filters\) enable higher power handling capabilities, however this comes with increased die dimensions. Performance over Temperature)
