/T (Insertion Losses  As Table 1 shows, the number of RF and filter band paths has increased dramatically in LTE-Advanced Pro and 5G smartphones. These additional paths increase insertion loss as signals pass through the system. Any increase in insertion loss reduces RF output, especially in the higher 5G FR1 ranges above 3 GHz. PA output can be increased to)
