/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (PCB Layouts in Stripline vs. Coplanar Waveguide Implementations  Because the land pattern of the BFHK-series filter package features conductive plating across the bottom surface as shown in Figure 1, simply soldering the unit to the exposed trace of a CPW board would cause functional issues due to shorting between the conductive metallizations on the PCB and the bottom surface of the filter. )
/E (PCB Layouts in Stripline vs. Coplanar Waveguide Implementations  Because the land pattern of the BFHK-series filter package features conductive plating across the bottom surface as shown in Figure 1, simply soldering the unit to the exposed trace of a CPW board would cause functional issues due to shorting between the conductive metallizations on the PCB and the bottom surface of the filter. )
/Pg 36 0 R
/K [7]
