/T (In closing, utilizing Modelithics measurement-based models combined with a discrete part-value optimization method within the Cadence AWR Design Environment can be an effective way to design filters. The approach pinpoints exactly which manufacturer part values are best suited for a design. A yield analysis can also be performed to determine the sensitivity with respect to component tolerances. )
