/T (High-Frequency BAW  5G uses new frequency bands that are well above those traditionally used for 4G LTE, and above the range customarily supported by BAW filters. These include new 5G Frequency Range 1 \(FR1\) and Frequency Range 2 \(FR2\) bands as shown in Figure 4 below. The upper limit of the Wi-Fi spectrum is also being extended above 7 GHz. Evolving BAW technology to support these considerably higher frequencies requires solving several technology challenge. Such as: )
